Data: California State Water Resources Control Board
----------------------------------------------------

Harmful algal bloom advisory records come from the State Water Resources
Control Board's Freshwater and Estuarine Harmful Algal Bloom (FHAB) Program,
published on the California Open Data Portal as "Surface Water - Freshwater
Harmful Algal Blooms":
https://data.ca.gov/dataset/surface-water-freshwater-harmful-algal-blooms

The dataset page states "License: Other (Public Domain)" and "Rights: No
Restrictions on Public Use" (read 2026-10-12). This repository uses no
state seals, logos or marks.

These files contain that data or data derived from it:

- pipeline/data/history.json
- pipeline/tests/fixtures/responses-sample_2026-10-09.csv (real rows)
- pipeline/tests/fixtures/dataset-page-2026-10-12.html (the dataset page)
- ios/AlgaeAlerts/Resources/snapshot.json
- the snapshot and website the pipeline builds

pipeline/tests/fixtures/responses-traps_2026-10-09.csv is hand-built test
data in the same column layout. Its waterbodies are invented.

Data: Missouri Department of Natural Resources
----------------------------------------------

Harmful algal bloom cases from the department's public map layer,
https://gis.dnr.mo.gov/host/rest/services/wqm/HAB_SUBMIT_POINTS/MapServer/6,
used under the State of Missouri Data Policy (https://mo.gov/data-policy),
which requires this disclaimer wherever the data is shown:

"The data made available here has been modified for use from its original
source, which is the State of Missouri. THE STATE OF MISSOURI MAKES NO
REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTY AS TO THE COMPLETENESS, ACCURACY, TIMELINESS, OR
CONTENT OF ANY DATA MADE AVAILABLE THROUGH THIS SITE. THE STATE OF MISSOURI
EXPRESSLY DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING ANY
IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, OR FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.
The data is subject to change as modifications and updates are complete. It
is understood that the information contained in the Web feed is being used
at one’s own risk."

The State may withdraw permission at any time. Files: pipeline/data/history.json
(records whose source is mo-dnr-hab) and
pipeline/tests/fixtures/mo-hab-points-2026-10-12.json.


Data: U.S. Environmental Protection Agency, CyAN
------------------------------------------------

Weekly satellite cyanobacteria estimates from the Cyanobacteria Assessment
Network (https://www.epa.gov/water-research/cyanobacteria-assessment-network-cyan),
derived from Copernicus Sentinel-3 data. A U.S. Government work; EPA does not
endorse this project. Files: pipeline/data/cyan.json and
pipeline/tests/fixtures/cyan-*.json (cyan-cache-traps.json is hand-built).


